casino  [Music]  all right the year 2020 will forever be  known as the covid induced pandemic year  where sports was sacked for months  all sports came to a screeching halt the  unexpected pit stop left sports fans  empty and yearning for more in its  return  and it did return we say good riddance  to 2020 but before we do we came up with  our own roster of las vegas  top 10 sports stories of 2020.  there always seems to be a las vegas  connection to every major event and  coming up with our top 10 we found a  pretty diverse list  we start with number 10 and count down  to number one at number 10  prep sports cancelled the impact was  huge more than 16 thousand roster spots  in las vegas alone were left empty  no football basketball baseball or any  other sport as the state  canceled spring fall and winter high  school sports which also affected the  recruiting of hundreds of kids who hope  to catch the eye of some college or  university program  at number nine combat sports in the  bubble ufc was the first to bring back  its sport president dana white held 30  fights at the ufc apex  while top rank hosted 25 boxing cards  nine of those world title fights  including the 2020 fight of the year  number eight was the announcement that a  6 000 seat arena will be funded and is  being built in henderson  the ahl club will be home to the  henderson silver knights who reveal  their brand  virtually the henderson city arena is  going to rival t-mobile  at number seven prior to the pandemic  unlv rolled into san diego state and  pulled off one of the great road upset  wins in school history when they slam  number four the aztecs who were the last  unbeatens in college basketball in 2020.  an undefeated season great win we move  on to number six  las vegas kurt busch after 22 races on  his home track  finally reaches the winner's circle he  captures the checkered flag  at the las vegas motor speedway without  fans but not without fanfare this is  what  kids dream of when they grow up racing  you dream of  winning at your hometown track as we  roll into number five at number five the  huge virus victory causing las vegas to  miss on millions in economic benefits  when the shoot shut on the nfr also the  nfl announcing the grand nfl draft party  scheduled for las vegas will be put on  hold for two years and the pbr  which held its world finals in las vegas  moved to texas because nevada state  leaders wouldn't even take a phone call  and i don't know if our plan has been  reviewed in detail by anybody at the  state level  number four takes us back to hockey  where the vegas golden knights play  through all sorts of craziness in the  bubble in edmonton and they reach the  western conference finals for the second  time in three years  at number three the ace is making our  city proud as the lady aces are the  number one seed  reaching the wnba finals for the first  time they eventually fall to seattle but  ace's forward asia wilson earns the  league's top honor as she is crowd the  wnba's most  valuable player we feel  we've underperformed a little bit coming  in at number two  the vegas golden knights just two years  after reaching the stanley cup finals  fire head coach gerard gallot shocking  everybody in the city  the stunning news giving fans their  first indication that major sports is  certainly a business  and not only firing gallant but the  knights hire the enemy you know for that  clown to say that in the paper yet peter  deboer sheds the clown  outfit and is hired to take over head  coaching responsibilities in vegas  and our number one story in this covid  crazy year no surprise  after nearly five years in the making  nfl football kicks off in las vegas  congratulations  to the las vegas raiders the raiders are  playing in a two billion dollar stadium  and who  knows someday in the near future our  number one story could be that las vegas  is hosting a super bowl because that  future number one story doesn't happen  if 2020's top story got sacked  and i hope the people in oakland get  some pleasure out of the raiders winning  here  tonight happy new year  to everybody in las vegas and here's to  a healthy and happy 2021.  can't wait to meet some of you people  and  god bless you all

